=== layout: one-panel

# Verification of Segregation

@body

- How do we verify the previous result of the Punnett square
- Monohybrid cross
  - Genotypic ratio of 1 AA\: 2 Aa\: 1 aa
  - Phenotypic ratio of 3 tall\: 1 short

